Name;Description;Level 0;Level 1;Level 2;Level 3;Level 4;Weight;EN Name;EN Description;EN Level 0;EN Level 1;EN Level 2;EN Level 3;EN Level 4;SK Name;SK Description;SK Level 0;SK Level 1;SK Level 2;SK Level 3;SK Level 4
Disclosure outside the organization;It means a situation where unauthorized persons outside the organization have access to sensitive (confidential) information. Impact level determines the maximum value of the negative impact of such a situation.;0;1;2;3;4;1;Impact in case of data leakage outside the organization;It means a situation where unauthorized persons outside the organization have access to sensitive (confidential) information. Impact level determines the maximum value of the negative impact of such a situation.;N/A;Minimal;Medium;Serious;Catastrophic;Dopad v prípade zverejnenia mimo organizáciu;Znamená situáciu, keď sa citlivé (dôverné) informácie dostatnú k nepovolaným a neautorizovaným osobám mimo organizáciu, a teda určenie maximálnej hodnoty negatívneho dopadu takejto situácie.;Neuplatňuje sa;Minimálny;Stredný;Závažný;Katastrofálny
Disclosure to unauthorized personnel;It means a situation where unauthorized persons within the organization have access to sensitive (confidential) information. Impact level determines the maximum value of the negative impact of such a situation.;0;1;2;3;4;0,8;Impact in case of data leakage to unauthorized persons within the organization;It means a situation where unauthorized persons within the organization have access to sensitive (confidential) information. Impact level determines the maximum value of the negative impact of such a situation.;N/A;Minimal;Medium;Serious;Catastrophic;Dopad v prípade sprístupnenia neoprávneným osobám v rámci organizácie;Znamená situáciu, keď sa citlivé (dôverné) informácie dostanú k nepovolaným a neautorizovaným osobám v rámci organizácie, a teda určenie maximálnej hodnoty negatívneho dopadu takejto situácie.;Neuplatňuje sa;Minimálny;Stredný;Závažný;Katastrofálny
Intentional breach of integrity;This is an assessment of the level of impact in the event that the data has been unauthorized and intentionally changed or damaged and thereby become untrustworthy. As a rule, this is a deliberate change with the aim of obtaining a certain benefit or other advantage, which can lead to wrong decisions, loss of trust, financial losses, etc.;0;1;2;3;4;1;Impact in case of intentional integrity violation;This is an assessment of the level of impact in the event that the data has been unauthorized and intentionally changed or damaged and thereby become untrustworthy. As a rule, this is a deliberate change with the aim of obtaining a certain benefit or other advantage, which can lead to wrong decisions, loss of trust, financial losses, etc.;N/A;Minimal;Medium;Serious;Catastrophic;Dopad v prípade úmyselného narušenia integrity;Ide o posúdenie úrovne dopadu v prípade, ak údaje boli neoprávnene a úmyselne zmenené alebo poškodené a tým sa stali nedôveryhodnými. Spravidla ide o úmyselnú zmenu s cieľom získania určitého prospechu alebo inej výhody, vďaka čomu môže dôjsť k chybným rozhodnutiam, strate dôvery, finančným stratám a pod.;Neuplatňuje sa;Minimálny;Stredný;Závažný;Katastrofálny
Unintentional breach of integrity;This is an assessment of the impact level if the data has been unintentionally altered, damaged or distorted by human, software or technical error. As a rule, these are common mistakes and typos without the intention of gaining benefit or other advantage, but the impact may still include incorrect decision -making, financial losses, reducing the credibility of the organization, etc.;0;1;2;3;4;0,9;Impact in case of unintentional integrity violation;This is an assessment of the impact level if the data has been unintentionally altered, damaged or distorted by human, software or technical error. As a rule, these are common mistakes and typos without the intention of gaining benefit or other advantage, but the impact may still include incorrect decision -making, financial losses, reducing the credibility of the organization, etc.;N/A;Minimal;Medium;Serious;Catastrophic;Dopad v prípade neúmyselného narušenia integrity;Ide o posúdenie úrovne dopadu v prípade, ak údaje boli neúmyselne zmenené, poškodené alebo skreslené vďaka ľudskej, softvérovej alebo technickej chybe. Spravidla ide o bežné chyby a preklepy bez úmyslu získania prospechu alebo inej výhody, ale aj napriek tomu dopad môže zahŕňať  nesprávne rozhodovanie, finančné straty, zníženie dôveryhodnosti organizácie a pod.;Neuplatňuje sa;Minimálny;Stredný;Závažný;Katastrofálny
Unavailability;It means the greatest negative effect in case of unavailability of the service / system, or determining the time interval of unavailability when the worst possible scenario occurs.;0;1;2;3;4;1;Impact in case of unavailability;It means the greatest negative effect in case of unavailability of the service / system, or determining the time interval of unavailability when the worst possible scenario occurs.;N/A;more than 3 days;more than 24 hours;more than 8 hours;More than an hour, or on the order of a few minutes;Dopad v prípade nedostupnosti;Znamená najväčší negatívny účinok v prípade nedostupnosti služby / systému, resp. určenie časového intervalu nedostupnosti kedy dôjde k najhoršiemu možnému scenáru.;Neuplatňuje sa;Viac ako 3 dni;Viac ako 24 hodín;Viac ako 8 hodín;Viac ako hodina, príp. rádovo pár minút
Loss of all data;It means that all information within a particular asset has been deleted or are unavailable. In particular, the importance of this data is taken into account for the organization's business processes and maximum impact to these processes should be assessed.;0;1;2;3;4;1;Impact in case of loss of all data;It means that all information within a particular asset has been deleted or are unavailable. In particular, the importance of this data is taken into account for the organization's business processes and maximum impact to these processes should be assessed.;N/A;Minimal;Medium;Serious;Catastrophic;Dopad v prípade straty všetkých údajov;Znamená, že všetky informácie v rámci konkrétneho aktíva boli zmazané alebo sa stali nedostupnými. Zohľadňuje sa najmä dôležitosť týchto dát pre biznis procesy organizácie a teda aký max. dopad môže mať táto strata na organizáciu.;Neuplatňuje sa;Minimálny;Stredný;Závažný;Katastrofálny
Legislation;This is mainly the impact in terms of violation of legislation and the resulting sanctions. In particular, it concerns laws and implementing regulations that the organization must comply with to ensure protection of data and systems from cyber attacks. Failure to comply with these regulations may lead to fines, sanctions, legal disputes, damages, etc.;0;1;2;3;4;1;Legislative impact;This is mainly the impact in terms of violation of legislation and the resulting sanctions. In particular, it concerns laws and implementing regulations that the organization must comply with to ensure protection of data and systems from cyber attacks. Failure to comply with these regulations may lead to fines, sanctions, legal disputes, damages, etc.;N/A;Disciplinary proceedings;Remedial action;Fine, compensation or criminal proceedings;Fine, compensation for damages, enforced performance, confiscation of property or criminal proceedings;Legislatívny dopad;Ide o dopad najmä z pohľadu porušenia legislatívy a z toho vyplývajúcich sankcií. Týka sa najmä zákonov a vykonávacích predpisov, ktoré organizácia musí dodržiavať, aby zabezpečila ochranu dát a systémov pred kybernetickými útokmi. Nedodržanie týchto predpisov môže viesť k pokutám, sankciám, právnym sporom, náhrade škody a pod.;Neuplatňuje sa;Disciplinárne konanie;Nápravné opatrenie;Pokuta, náhrada škody alebo trestné konanie;Pokuta, náhrada škody, nútený výkon, zabavenie majetku alebo trestné konanie
Finance;It concerns costs and losses that the organization may suffer as a result of security disturbances or cyber attack. The costs may include direct financial losses from theft or fraud, fines, forensic and other analysis costs, system renewal costs, damages, etc.;0;1;2;3;4;1;Financial impact;It concerns costs and losses that the organization may suffer as a result of security disturbances or cyber attack. The costs may include direct financial losses from theft or fraud, fines, forensic and other analysis costs, system renewal costs, damages, etc.;N/A;less than 3k EUR;3k - 33k EUR;33k - 250k EUR;250k EUR and more;Finančný dopad;Týka sa nákladov a strát, ktoré môže utrpieť organizácia v dôsledku narušenia bezpečnosti alebo kybernetického útoku. Náklady môžu zahŕňať priame finančné straty z krádeže alebo podvodu, pokuty, náklady na forenzné a iné analýzy, náklady na obnovu systémov, náhradu škody a pod.;Neuplatňuje sa;Menej ako 3 tis. EUR;3k - 33k EUR;33k - 250k EUR;250 tisíc EUR a viac
Reputation;It refers to the negative impact that a cyber attack or any breach of the information security of a specific asset can have on the reputation of the organization. The consequences may include long-term damage to the brand, a decrease in sales, a decrease in the number of customers, or even of dissolution of the organization, etc.;0;1;2;3;4;0,7;Impact on reputation;It refers to the negative impact that a cyber attack or any breach of the information security of a specific asset can have on the reputation of the organization. The consequences may include long-term damage to the brand, a decrease in sales, a decrease in the number of customers, or even of dissolution of the organization, etc.;N/A;Minimal;Medium;Serious;Catastrophic;Dopad na reputáciu;Týka sa negatívneho vplyvu, ktorý môže mať kybernetický útok alebo akékoľvek narušenie informačnej bezpečnosti konkrétneho aktíva na povesť a dobré meno organizácie. Dôsledky môžu zahŕňať dlhodobé poškodenie značky, pokles predaja, zníženie počtu zákazníkov, prípadne aj zánik organizácie a pod.;Neuplatňuje sa;Minimálny;Stredný;Závažný;Katastrofálny
Operation external;It refers to the impact of cyber attacks or security incidents on external aspects of the organization such as relationships with clients, suppliers or other external partners. It may involve disruption of the services or products that the organization provides, which may lead to loss of trust and business opportunities, or loss of clients, etc.;0;1;2;3;4;1;Operational impact external;It refers to the impact of cyber attacks or security incidents on external aspects of the organization such as relationships with clients, suppliers or other external partners. It may involve disruption of the services or products that the organization provides, which may lead to loss of trust and business opportunities, or loss of clients, etc.;N/A;Minimal;Medium;Serious;Catastrophic;Prevádzkový dopad externý;Týka sa vplyvu kybernetických útokov alebo bezpečnostných incidentov na vonkajšie aspekty organizácie ako sú vzťahy s klientami, dodávateľmi či inými externými partnermi. Môže zahŕňať narušenie služieb alebo produktov, ktoré organizácia poskytuje, čo môže viesť k strate dôvery a obchodných príležitostí, prípadne k strate klientov a pod.;Neuplatňuje sa;Minimálny;Stredný;Závažný;Katastrofálny
Operation internal;It concerns the impact of cyber attacks or security incidents on internal processes and the daily operation of the organization. Includes disruption of workflows, reduction of productivity, downtime in the provision of services, etc.;0;1;2;3;4;0,8;Operational impact internal;It concerns the impact of cyber attacks or security incidents on internal processes and the daily operation of the organization. Includes disruption of workflows, reduction of productivity, downtime in the provision of services, etc.;N/A;Employee or max. one organizational unit;Min. one organizational unit / section;Several organizational units / sections;The whole organization;Prevádzkový dopad interný;Týka sa vplyvu kybernetických útokov alebo bezpečnostných incidentov na vnútorné procesy a každodennú prevádzku organizácie. Zahŕňa narušenie pracovných tokov, zníženie produktivity, prestoje v poskytovaní služieb a pod.;Neuplatňuje sa;Zamestnanec alebo max. jeden org. útvar;Min. jeden org. útvar / sekcia;Niekoľko organizačných útvarov / sekcií;Celá organizácia
Clients;These are the negative effects that a cyber incident or any breach of the information security of a specific asset can have on the organization's clients/customers. This can include the compromise of personal data, financial losses, service disruptions and an overall decrease in trust in the organization.;0;1;2;3;4;1;Impact on clients;These are the negative effects that a cyber incident or any breach of the information security of a specific asset can have on the organization's clients/customers. This can include the compromise of personal data, financial losses, service disruptions and an overall decrease in trust in the organization.;N/A;Minimal;Medium;Serious;Catastrophic;Dopad na klientov;Ide o negatívne účinky, ktoré môže mať kybernetický incident alebo akékoľvek narušenie informačnej bezpečnosti konkrétneho aktíva na klientov / zákazníkov organizácie. Môže to zahŕňať kompromitáciu osobných údajov, finančné straty, narušenie služieb a celkové zníženie dôvery v organizáciu.;Neuplatňuje sa;Minimálny;Stredný;Závažný;Katastrofálny
Health and human lives;The impact of unavailability or of any violation of information security of the assessed asset (e.g. integrity violation of data) on health or human lives.;0;1;2;3;4;1;Impact on health and human lives;The impact of unavailability or of any violation of information security of the assessed asset (e.g. integrity violation of data) on health or human lives.;N/A;Hit max. 3 persons, without direct risk of death;Affected max. 10 persons, without direct risk of death;Affected max. 100 persons, without direct risk of death;Affected by more than 100 persons, or the risk of death min. one person;Dopad na zdravie a ľudské životy;Vplyv znefunkčnenia alebo akéhokoľvek narušenia informačnej bezpečnosti posudzovaného aktíva na zdravie alebo ľudské životy, a teda určenie max. hodnoty tohto dopadu.;Neuplatňuje sa;Zasiahnuté max. 3 osoby, bez priameho rizika úmrtia;Zasiahnutých max. 10 osôb, bez priameho rizika úmrtia;Zasiahnutých max. 100 osôb, bez priameho rizika úmrtia;Zasiahnutých viac ako 100 osôb, alebo riziko úmrtia min. jednej osoby
